# Cross-confirm twin of freestyle_4t.script: the same route with circle and cross swapped
# (0x2000 <-> 0x4000), because with EMOTIONALSENSE_CONFIRM=cross the host's cross is the
# game's confirm. Run it with --confirm cross.
# FreeStyle 4T: title -> FreeStyle -> 4T -> first song (Trip, id 18).
# The first entry is a song the original save had locked, so reaching scene 3
# proves the unlock fix builds a usable list. Used by scripts/check_scripts.sh.
